{"seq":1,"slug":"precipitation","title":"降水：雨雪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/precipitation","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"降水-雨雪\">降水：雨雪</h1><p>下雨看起来只是「往屏幕上撒一堆白线」，真做起来却处处是取舍：几万滴雨怎样不拖垮帧率、雨该不该被屋顶挡住、雪落地要不要堆积、镜头淋到雨要不要挂水珠。这一篇把降水拆成三个层次——空中的下落、落地的反馈、地表的累积——并明确它从<a href=\"weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a>的 <code>precipitation</code> 与 <code>temperature</code> 取值、向<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a>和玩法供值的接口关系。本 hub 负责「下多大、下哪里、累积成什么」，具体的粒子渲染细节归<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/\">VFX 粒子系统</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个层次的降水\">核心概念：三个层次的降水</h2><p>一场雨在玩家感知上是连贯的，但实现上要拆成三个独立又联动的层：<strong>下落层</strong>是空中飞行的雨滴雪花，决定「看得见在下」；<strong>反馈层</strong>是雨打在地面、水面、伞面溅起的涟漪与水花，决定「看得见打到东西」；<strong>累积层</strong>是地表逐渐变湿、积水、积雪这类有状态的量，决定「下过之后世界变了」。三层取的都是同一个 <code>precipitation</code> 强度，但更新频率与表现手段完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[状态机: precipitation/temperature] --&gt; B{温度判雨雪}&#10;  B --&gt;|温度&gt;0| C[雨下落层]&#10;  B --&gt;|温度&lt;0| D[雪下落层]&#10;  C --&gt; E[反馈层: 涟漪/水花]&#10;  D --&gt; F[反馈层: 雪花消融]&#10;  E --&gt; G[累积层: 湿度/积水]&#10;  F --&gt; H[累积层: 积雪厚度]&#10;  G --&gt; I[湿润表现/玩法摩擦]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[状态机: precipitation/temperature] --&gt; B{温度判雨雪}\n  B --&gt;|温度&gt;0| C[雨下落层]\n  B --&gt;|温度&lt;0| D[雪下落层]\n  C --&gt; E[反馈层: 涟漪/水花]\n  D --&gt; F[反馈层: 雪花消融]\n  E --&gt; G[累积层: 湿度/积水]\n  F --&gt; H[累积层: 积雪厚度]\n  G --&gt; I[湿润表现/玩法摩擦]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>下表对比雨与雪在三层上的差异，说明为何不能用同一套参数糊弄过去：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>雨</th>\n<th>雪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下落速度</td>\n<td>快（约 9 m/s），近垂直</td>\n<td>慢（约 1 m/s），随风飘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受风影响</td>\n<td>轻微倾斜</td>\n<td>强烈，几乎水平横飞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈</td>\n<td>涟漪、水花、溅射</td>\n<td>落地即停或缓慢消融</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积</td>\n<td>湿度上升、低洼积水</td>\n<td>厚度叠加、压实、融化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染密度</td>\n<td>高（细长线）</td>\n<td>中（飘动点片）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"下落层-粒子与屏幕空间的取舍\">下落层：粒子与屏幕空间的取舍</h2><p>铺满视野的雨滴若用真实粒子，数量轻易上万，逐个模拟下落代价高。两种主流做法各有适用。<strong>GPU 粒子</strong>把雨滴作为实例在顶点/计算着色器里更新位置，适合中近景、需要和场景碰撞溅射的雨；其架构与发射器细节属于<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/\">VFX 粒子系统</a>。<strong>屏幕空间/相机锁定雨幕</strong>则用几层贴着相机的半透明纹理滚动，用极低代价铺满远景大雨——玩家不会注意远处每滴雨的真实位置。实践中两者叠加：近景 GPU 粒子求真实，远景纹理雨幕求覆盖。</p>\n<p>雨滴的下落不是纯垂直，要叠加<a href=\"wind-simulation\">风场模拟</a>的风矢量做平流。设雨滴终端速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_{rain}=(0,-9,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，风场在该点的风矢量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则实际速度近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}=\\vec{v}_{rain}+k\\vec{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，雪的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于雨（雪轻、随风强）。这条「降水查风做平流」的依赖是天气现象篇内部最重要的耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈层-让雨-打到东西\">反馈层：让雨「打到东西」</h2><p>只有下落没有反馈，雨会显得像穿过世界的幽灵。反馈层在雨滴击中表面处生成涟漪与水花。关键问题是「打到哪了」——若对每滴雨做射线检测代价过高。两种省力做法：一是<strong>深度图碰撞</strong>，把粒子位置投影到深度缓冲，深度匹配处判定为击中，一次全屏处理大量粒子；二是<strong>程序化涟漪贴图</strong>，在湿润表面材质里叠加一张随时间滚动的涟漪法线动画，强度随 <code>precipitation</code> 调制，完全不依赖真实粒子，开销恒定。后者是性价比最高的方案，它的落地属于<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a>。</p>\n<p>水面上的反馈更明显——雨点会在水体上激起密集涟漪，这部分若需要真实波动，要把降水强度作为扰动源喂给<a href=\"../../game-fluid-simulation/\">流体模拟</a>的水面解算，本 hub 只提供「这里在下多大的雨」，不负责解水波。</p>\n<h2 id=\"累积层-有状态的湿与雪\">累积层：有状态的湿与雪</h2><p>累积层是降水最容易被省略、却最能体现「时间流逝」的部分。雨水让地表湿度随时间上升，停雨后缓慢蒸发；这套湿度场是<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a>的输入。积雪更复杂：它是一个随时间叠加、可被踩出脚印、随温度融化的厚度场。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[降水强度 P] --&gt; B[累积速率 dH/dt]&#10;  C[温度 T] --&gt; D{T&gt;0?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[融化速率 抵消累积]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[纯累积]&#10;  B --&gt; G[积雪/湿度厚度场 H]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[材质混合: 露土-&gt;全白]&#10;  G --&gt; I[玩法: 留脚印/降速]\">flowchart TD\n  A[降水强度 P] --&gt; B[累积速率 dH/dt]\n  C[温度 T] --&gt; D{T&gt;0?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[融化速率 抵消累积]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[纯累积]\n  B --&gt; G[积雪/湿度厚度场 H]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[材质混合: 露土-&gt;全白]\n  G --&gt; I[玩法: 留脚印/降速]</pre><p>积雪厚度场可建模为一张随时间更新的纹理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(\\vec{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，累积速率正比于降水、融化速率正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(0, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dH}{dt}=\\alpha P - \\beta \\max(0,T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。厚度驱动地表材质从「露土」混合到「全白覆盖」，并触发玩法层的留痕与减速（见<a href=\"../practice/weather-gameplay\">天气玩法影响</a>）。这种有状态的累积是廉价但极有说服力的细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>降水拆成下落、反馈、累积三层，共享 <code>precipitation</code> 强度但更新频率与手段各异。</li>\n<li>雨与雪在下落速度、受风、反馈、累积上差异巨大，由温度判据切换，不可共用一套参数。</li>\n<li>下落层近景用 GPU 粒子求真、远景用相机锁定雨幕求覆盖；下落要叠加风场平流（雪的平流系数远大于雨）。</li>\n<li>反馈层优先用深度图碰撞与程序化涟漪贴图，避免逐滴射线；水面真实波动交给流体兄弟 hub。</li>\n<li>累积层用随时间演化的湿度/积雪厚度场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，是「时间流逝」最廉价有力的体现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>降水强度与雨雪判据的来源：<a href=\"../foundations/weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a></li>\n<li>下落平流依赖的风矢量：<a href=\"wind-simulation\">风场模拟</a></li>\n<li>累积湿度的视觉落地：<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a></li>\n<li>雨滴粒子的发射与生命周期：<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/\">VFX 粒子系统</a></li>\n<li>水面真实波动的解算：<a href=\"../../game-fluid-simulation/\">流体模拟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"降水：雨雪","id":"降水-雨雪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个层次的降水","id":"核心概念-三个层次的降水"},{"level":2,"text":"下落层：粒子与屏幕空间的取舍","id":"下落层-粒子与屏幕空间的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈层：让雨「打到东西」","id":"反馈层-让雨-打到东西"},{"level":2,"text":"累积层：有状态的湿与雪","id":"累积层-有状态的湿与雪"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"区域与局部天气","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/foundations/regional-weather"},"next":{"title":"风场模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/phenomena/wind-simulation"}}